use wrap from "std:list"
variable entries is list of "a", "b", "c", "d"
variable idx is 1
constant delta is -3
change idx to the result of wrap idx + delta in length of entries
say item idx of entries
change idx to the result of wrap idx + 6 in length of entries
say item idx of entries
change idx to the result of wrap idx + 0 in length of entries
say item idx of entries
